
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>카페 메뉴 관리</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>카페 메뉴 관리</h1>

  <h2>1. 메뉴 추가</h2>

  <form action="/menus/add" method="POST">
    메뉴명:
    <input type="text" name="menu" maxlength="100" required>

    가격:
    <input type="number" name="price" min="0" required>

    수량:
    <input type="number" name="quantity" min="0" required>

    <button type="submit">추가</button>
  </form>

  <hr>

  <h2>2. ID 상세 조회</h2>

  <form id="searchForm">
    ID:
    <input type="number" id="searchId" min="1" required>
    <button type="submit">조회</button>
  </form>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("searchForm").addEventListener(
      "submit",
      function(event) {
        event.preventDefault();

        const id = document.getElementById("searchId").value;
        window.location.href = "/menus/" + encodeURIComponent(id);
      }
    );
  </script>

  <% if (selected) { %>
    <h3>상세 조회 결과</h3>
    <p>ID: <%= selected.id %></p>
    <p>메뉴명: <%= selected.menu %></p>
    <p>가격: <%= selected.price %>원</p>
    <p>수량: <%= selected.quantity %></p>
  <% } %>

  <hr>

  <h2>3. 메뉴 수정</h2>

  <form action="/menus/edit" method="POST">
    ID:
    <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required>

    메뉴명:
    <input type="text" name="menu" maxlength="100" required>

    가격:
    <input type="number" name="price" min="0" required>

    수량:
    <input type="number" name="quantity" min="0" required>

    <button type="submit">수정</button>
  </form>

  <hr>

  <h2>4. 메뉴 삭제</h2>

  <form action="/menus/delete"
        method="POST"
        onsubmit="return confirm('정말 삭제하시겠습니까?')">

    ID:
    <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required>

    <button type="submit">삭제</button>
  </form>

  <hr>

  <h2>5. 전체 메뉴 조회</h2>

  <table border="1">
    <tr>
      <th>ID</th>
      <th>메뉴명</th>
      <th>가격</th>
      <th>수량</th>
    </tr>

    <% menus.forEach(function(item) { %>
      <tr>
        <td><%= item.id %></td>
        <td><%= item.menu %></td>
        <td><%= item.price %></td>
        <td><%= item.quantity %></td>
      </tr>
    <% }); %>
  </table>

  <p><a href="/">전체 목록 새로고침</a></p>

</body>
</html>

